  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34777e26818ebaf00357dae6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紧张哟～飞走吧～！\n虽然腿有点抖，\n但还是会注意不摔倒的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e63025de4fcdb8d828acf479df1cfb0a8863a2301e10d2d8fce0b59fa9108975",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b08ad577b28dbd37b58374c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "慌慌张张～慌慌张张～。\n呜呜，脚好紧张…\n振作点啊，我～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aed4730998888324b06706a05f5685f22e1d8d72c1143d89f2c2265cd2591456",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27699d091da2e64c5c757184",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "深、深呼吸一下ー…吸ー呼ー，\n吸ー呼ー吸吸…咳咳！\n吸，吸过头了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "98d70daa24f093278070e6eb68e301caa55c49ca43af066cf2f7f9fa55a9341c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2e30a89276c7317188e6bbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总总，总感觉有点\n紧张…！没关系，\n冷静下来的话就能做到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ff9ef341d7345391fb678ef77b82d88d8eec486493ee9e504079dc5d87b3878",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e67921ebd69947a4d329ad41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发咯～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c498de605db4e3b7f3b9d67f3262d1a08815897496abb495ba1fdf6d6020874",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afac26d6a8202194c173bd6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "efd80b5bbf7c87efe961b7d4b6678e0e51c03a5cc7ad8ddda46c544622b2e5c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:915e9c67a01bc2a1dd0ae9ea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油咯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ceddc16f7d720db2f78331384b57277e53823adda66daaa5b8e27f1aad39bff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20229e1b3c33c193c345d3b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼呣呼呣！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ac791234dc1c8a699ec2ee4e96da26c22b7359ae8ded8b5c9375859f9041738",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e64a9a3230915350dc3f491a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊呀哇～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "206d52dda559f58812a7870bcd8f2b921ea3b9369a774a1ad7788fa635fac897",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d39cc37552481e31ddc555be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咕哇…",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c835eab7cad68a53b6345e77dbc2594b4f0add8cc30d3afdd9a0f0be887213a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f70dafcfe9c7d95f08bf35d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e614f61077baa5c32c3da74aeeadf26136d27b54dd9da15478f03b2843c04ca3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0d89e24edd4cf5c59a62d74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大海呀～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0978a38f97c31bb42956f46991c73b5bebad0403dde1096e6c3221365626dfa4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:818a7d6ace88830d140ce1fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多亏了训练员，我充分努力哦…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2e698d55937dabf8d02f5a743d4514c7f50a79a566b51432835ef7d142667bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b3dec447f25472dad565c4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的，十分感谢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4514a4f2de767f5d70c75212cb494a5e89255dea760e41e6073af28282a9e54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9a5ad9b7dd92fd7d2aaeb1f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呣！加油～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c8aab72b5228a13306c76298bf395b0a96e9cfdd99366174f351b9b8d29fdcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ddc99662b63fc488d2377e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，加油咯ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3bfbffc1bc9d1f595b2f80d07551bfd5f48273972e52bbe97e12d08f4c09c2b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:165a3c94998c5eac3c3c2f12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，加油咯～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8cbc84f835589156798bf0e5cfb8b49507c3a548ffa015a8c775ef24935c08f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3df61b0a0f3b385fe39679b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的，十分感谢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4514a4f2de767f5d70c75212cb494a5e89255dea760e41e6073af28282a9e54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dde890cdbee5049346237b11",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到这里为止都感觉良好，\n没问题的吧。\n接下来就是气势了～呣呣～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d98cd167f3a5a05c9e3f532568419824e04c88d67516f76c8a48f6a2bde272d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:830c071b8a60181ad34ea9d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "记下来的笔记也复习完了，\n剩下就是全力奔跑了…！\n好，好好看着吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "440d750c59df54f149c566450642790797287328c757b70b835a70239c49bb7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:79bf5f5c45e24b33ff4a10b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真的，十分感谢！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4514a4f2de767f5d70c75212cb494a5e89255dea760e41e6073af28282a9e54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:274afbe22098ff65dc02b361",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "よーし！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e548208329c219ba46218e46dc381f3a2964dbf221f890a7ff2ac40af246165a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f99a6b7f1568b91238c1fbcd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哟～！再稍微，再稍微！",
      "source_fingerprint": "788b48f9ce84e41070cdc0bbde0c9a06635809758f5bbb8b67b43501d13d1e1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1194e45d6a6819918309328f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呣，从现在开始咯～",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f0ce1940f19c74a545aff086fbd214bc35f4fc762c36f83f454e93d3281afc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0524cef9b2bf998a7fb7df4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更多更～多，向前方加油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c408b190bc52e6be9d03ab493691ebadeaddea65c4893d689a5f4a1349b58a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b8eb8c7b18b538b80d14e60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么嘛，还差得远呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "962136c42f8142dc476e91e9b0155b7d9118e9d40e7b680868e003c6788acf03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f0324f6bd0bf12442c39450",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好耶好ー耶，好耶耶ー嘻嘻♪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d851e585ba0cbe0622589ea733d6daa06a46e70c4f0e71b0716c61ee84f5226",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:042b41635c2a9ccc201a6d7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的奔跑，一定要好好记住！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86b7f01d22497da9f5e14ac1d42d35f75f907a88383473d1cf8cfca7eb098dc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a29b3ad88394173ecb1e43a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶嘿嘿……\r\n我有让大家看见我厉害的一面了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f7cb110823d9586922da276167866cea6e14dca1b04030e313aff17b3bf1997",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73cdd83127260d4f0dbb1094",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "得好好记住今天的跑法才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "305d19571526725f162ddae7aa834ecec2df9fbc244bbf9d8a815e72566b3485",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34e8514e04655ece305badee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不会输的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc71670b822a05337e60f6fd65bd5941f83e26ae8f18fb2472afc9ca941b74e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:913c5b8accbfdc94f26ceafb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇等等～，怎么了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fdc34319e8122908d4a0918392c984c671f785e3473ef69f22ad0966d9e737b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca4da64513b752ea35894c88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "叔叔他总是在观众席上，\r\n挥舞着双手为我加油！\r\n……真想好好回应他呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "17967beaef855e18127687a6d0d297db7ed665e0b0bc6c085ca7f8bc4a3ae314",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b4c447cf49b480d764cf072",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "きっと私だけだったら、森の中を\r\n大冒険！なんてならなかったよね。\r\nありがたや、ありがたや～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da6c70a15b3b62da7b88e17098c7cc6db972ac742dd47d7841a1f1c9a4510346",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b50f7e5cf33d312dbcf3ec77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "素质说她们也会来帮我加油呢！\r\n这下就得全力以赴永不放弃啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7da44fdb1c88947e5779c2184110db24751d92b838907ef1d5e774fdc4db792",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cee6066ada854e8c51eb0813",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みんなとお宝探しなんて、\r\n楽しいソロキャンだー！\r\n…ソロキャン？　…みんキャン！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e8ef6f54089dca3a8e1f8d6e91d6dfc6066ea25ba8ad3c68e1e8a39f1eb8aa6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3a806d73897c7bcbeca9043",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "笔记本就绪ー，毛巾就绪ー，\n状态…今天也很～～好！！\n加油咯ー！诶，诶，呣！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31532892c5ffaa9fdfeb06530f284f849b39c3742b9254f11e06fe680c6726eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d714830468587724d505268",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是生野一直想看到的景色……\r\n耶嘿嘿，对我来说\r\n也成为了特别的回忆！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65d8cd1ec1e72d8b48cdf2c348c3447c282d22e957aa2fdd821079f51ff04f55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eed1c66b2c567fad7a1d055",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇等等～，怎么了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fdc34319e8122908d4a0918392c984c671f785e3473ef69f22ad0966d9e737b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9333fd0e372d94ee9ec74aef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动任务在这里哦♪\n要完成哦～。\n诶，诶，呣！",
      "source_fingerprint": "304f400868e8ad08bf4dbcae267913281e869d9ef147f9feedb45505c28efeda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb2fe33353addaa22548a789",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动任务，幸苦啦～！\n今天想好好地\n泡个澡…叭叭叭～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ce158ef47c2df2d15a5017b4f8f340d9d8f7e889a920203c5f7b823cb8ded83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ab5d39bf3f66032d77eb7dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶，诶，呣！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbbd67612cd66b4db85fe8a412ad9ac056de5ed4baa80e7807935d4b5da24997",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d7dfb3793ff327adfda3982",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回应吧啊啊～～～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8db4aee1d67abcfa31fd6194498c6b24931a2d111328e085d157ce6bf1f10aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6466bc4c88577ffb2a90eaff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回应大家的声援吧啊啊～～！？\r\n……嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49b91a757358261e7cb1e4bb0e629031934ac3215d355088feff44bdab6d91d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:283154a193f30bc7207247c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "铛铛铛的hohohoyー♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "678321e23be7868d12d17e3d0857324669887a5c824bd9da289de8e6f622ff58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ec785ac170521ce15e4c900",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢，传达到了哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bd11ed36183b489f15b9a9bfa28ff80f3ddadf4aea22420bf15006e36595482",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c840b3c8b2ea4df5411d7f86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "加油咯ー！诶，诶，呣！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd1cc1f40496f5cf26d7306d3cb08a6ce97a596a944a679d8d4bb49779f54101",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:737a6f5661de65eafd6b387d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员经常把各种各样的东西\n都平分呢～。机会难得，\n把回忆也平分…什么的～嘻嘻",
      "source_fingerprint": "56d06b6144606690a460970e99c57d3618834c1a6f7200b46fe3d881cca2eba9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec159ef7e7655266b93171c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服的颜色也好，款式也好，\n和我的帽子都是最～佳搭配对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2d0e4cdb9e0e64feed2718238db6f9f21f20324e5b2cc8fd275876d5226d6d4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9dc10acde2f27b55637411d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哒哒铛♪\n穿上这个就变得很想跳舞了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5a3b3e0aee394cbb4a946b6e0c5d880412fc035470cfce2c0cab1c241ae26e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b682736657f964ac7a64da3f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我自己的特别决胜服…\n这样一来，“叭叭”地向瞄准第一～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7b33ea05f47264e8b0c8ab822fe3578a0e4662f8a34ef951995fde7e424518d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c453c4cb251a132a0986483",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "制服，很可爱吧。\n怎么样，合适吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "241bc54f9fd160c2a00ef0e9f3f64fe805e72fbc0023ad5b9e438bc744fb1fe1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:804dcad7effca923f422d028",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果在舞台上失败了，\n就会在不好的意义上引人注目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cc83de707ef4f5c125e9c2d856466429af8f2b7e67c9c493c45483f170c3b03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a825b222780573af5aa0cff9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿上这件衣服的我，\n能被大家记住就好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "26b254fa30e1ecbd5cb86444f48b76e455b331998c2a284a1a1b126048504269",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3a81b4e10c2d39a19a8bf8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是蓝色版诗歌剧！\r\n宛如蓝色火焰熊熊燃烧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf980965482c807bd6ceba0c5ec53507f13043ba0c7ca6ab92147b1081e11ec6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed07d19d16496afd63228696",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要赢、要赢、要赢哦──！\r\n请帮我加油！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7590896c35626bf5a9b1d9344e6188d286e26f9e7f66fe84900e61c24c409857",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ca800bf21aa91872aae09ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锵锵ー，怎么样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "24ea66df4d96676feeb255b85c5bfb466927db0f6bad9d571025487e163b1eee",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ff765f606de2884ed8dab28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服，很有气势呢。\n呣呣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5b7a6d4bf2423d253a7f64054988d5a84ef1091cf4d567abdabe0582d90affa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dafb0a59c57bcf72a12e158",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "んーっ！やっぱり自分で\r\n選んだ服は落ち着きますっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4674267c307a12cae7f1e7f560ce3e76d581aa23a0ae3d206e5815a50ca0c3ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4ba3a61b926c6a76256e75c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ゆるめで動きやすい服、ってなると、大体\r\n同じようなお洋服になっちゃうんですよねぇ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "038ad0a87385e3cce44defafce3ad8cac0fcc6cb83e7f69ae48e4c6ee57d0ade",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1062",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3be3209695ca7a807bc86d99",
